# Only the starting value, and only until a server is chosen on the connect
# screen — the app stores that choice and overrides this on every later launch.
#
# It matters for one case: a `pnpm ship` build, which spawns its own backend on
# the sidecar port. Must match sidecar::API_PORT in src-tauri/src/sidecar/mod.rs.
# A release build from CI spawns nothing, so its first screen is the connect
# screen and this value is never used.
#
# No secrets here — checked in on purpose so `pnpm ship` is reproducible.
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:47821/api/v1
